sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant Socket8080 as HTTP Server (Port 8080)
  participant VertxEventLoop as Vert.x Event Loop Thread (V1)
  participant Verticle as Verticle Handler (V1)
  participant VertxAnyThread as Vert.x Event Loop Thread (Vx)

  Client->>Socket8080: HTTP Request (R1)
  Socket8080->>VertxEventLoop: Event loop thread V1
  VertxEventLoop->>Verticle: Non-blocking handler (V1)
  Verticle-->>VertxEventLoop: Release thread (V1, async DB call)
  Note right of Verticle: V1 is free for other events
  Verticle->>VertxAnyThread: Callback (Vx, any event loop thread)
  VertxAnyThread-->>Socket8080: Send response (Vx)
  Socket8080-->>Client: HTTP Response (R1)